hangelog">v<!-- -->3.4.0</a></div></aside><main class="documentation-sidebar__content"><h1 class="bold" id="how-to-choose-the-right-spacing-value"><a class="underline reset-text-decoration" href="choose-the-right-spacing-value#how-to-choose-the-right-spacing-value">How to choose the right spacing value</a></h1>
<ol>
<li><strong>Less space between small or functionally related elements</strong></li>
<li><strong>More space between bigger or less related elements</strong></li>
</ol>
<p>Space improves text readability and scannability. If elements don’t have enough
spacing, it gets difficult to see their hierarchy correctly.</p>
<p>Related elements should be visually grouped together and the unrelated ones
should have more space to “breathe”.</p>
